 not  all bad um after we left our apartment  for our condo august 19th we were  evicted  um we fell through a loophole where our  lease was three months  and um since the eviction moratorium  only  um that was the word um  contents of the people that have  full-time leases we had he got evicted  so we called move for less last minute  and i said please come save  us and they were right there to help us  with everything the employees were  awesome  i know one man his name was drew i can't  remember his friend but they were  awesome  highly recommended i mean they were they  were the best  while she wasn't able to move due to all  the things going on here in southern  nevada  we were able to get her moved into our  storage unit within 24 hours  i mean it means a lot it means a lot  it's been really hard and i'm just happy  that  there's somebody out there that really  cares  in my own community and has helped us so  much and it has brought me  to believe that there are people out  there that will help  i'm sorry it's been very difficult  finding help um before i reached out to  remove for less  i was hitting charity after charity  churches  but they're so overwhelmed and booked up  that i couldn't get anything  and it was very frustrating and there  are times that you just want to give up  but i didn't have that option so i would  just keep going online making phone  calls  and that's when i reached out to move  for less and  i sent them an email and i was happy to  become one of their recipients so  i almost you know fell out and cried  when i got the phone call from eric  going through this time i mean i've had  my lows  um but to to be honest i think i've been  managing  well pretty well i always say that um  god doesn't give you more than you can  handle and i'm not saying you know to be  preachy or anything but  i really feel like the strong do survive  and this is just a test it's just a  temporary struggle and if anyone else is  having a hard time  just you kn